  "Metadata": {
    "RepoURL": "git@github.com:essensys-hub/essensys-server-backend.git",
    "Commit": "02b2d3455e7199ccdfb5119ede535fb6c3471761",
    "CommitMsg": "fix(tests): repair Go test compilation (BasicAuth/NewRouter/AcknowledgeAction/GetFullTable) (SCRUM-9) (#7)\n\nUpdate test files to current production API signatures so `go test ./...`\ncompiles again (the non-test build was already fine):\n\n- BasicAuth now takes (map[string]string, data.Store); tests pass nil store.\n- NewRouter now takes (*Handler, *WebHandler, *UniFiHandler, map, bool, data.Store);\n  call sites updated with nil web/unifi handlers and the in-scope store.\n- AcknowledgeAction now returns (*protocol.Action, bool); callers updated.\n- DatabaseStore was missing GetFullTable required by the Store interface\n  (interface-compliance test could not build) — implemented it.\n\nMinimal production bug fix:\n- internal/data/memory_store.go: remove duplicate `return result` (dead code\n  flagged by `go vet`).\n\nTests asserting intentionally-removed behavior are skipped with a clear reason\n(SCRUM-9): BasicAuth passive mode (no 401) and the new single-line [GO] logger\nformat (no [REQUEST]/[RESPONSE]/[JSON_NORMALIZATION] tags or logged status).\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor \u003ccursoragent@cursor.com\u003e",
    "Author": "rhinosys \u003cnicolas.rineau@rhinosys.fr\u003e",
    "Committer": "GitHub \u003cnoreply@github.com\u003e"
  },
